Sliding Window

Expansion - Adding into the window
Shrinking - Deleting from the window

Time complexity - O(n-k)

sliding window - Fixed sized
                 Variable size  k is not given


variable size -- two phase
Expansion : Adding into the window
Shrinking : Deleting from the window

